weakened in familiar source/separation collocations. Newlines respond strongly
at document starts and in fragmented, short-line text. Lone spaces
are negative as indentation, positive when repeated. Blank lines with ragged
padding respond more than padding aligned to four spaces. Other tokens are
near zero. Track line lengths incrementally and reset at each document.
