"""Layer-0 MLP down_proj component 1041: a token-shape detector.

What it does, in plain terms: this component is quiet on almost every token (std 0.055)
and speaks mainly on short word fragments, i.e. sub-word pieces of a longer word, where the
piece itself is written in a Latin or Cyrillic alphabet and has no leading space.
