"""Detect joins between short alphabetic fragments.

A capital after a short lowercase fragment (mV, qPCR, cName) gives a
positive response. Short same-case joins, especially consonant clusters,
give a negative response. Ordinary word boundaries are nearly neutral.
These are spelling rules, not a dictionary of particular tokens.
